##  Overview

**RaiseUp** is a modern matchmaking platform connecting **startups** looking for funding with **investors** seeking innovative projects.  
It provides a clean and intuitive interface, chat and match features, and real-time data synchronization.

This platform is built with:

- **Frontend:** Angular 19 (standalone components, Material UI)
- **Backend:** Node.js + Express + Prisma ORM
- **Database:** PostgreSQL
- **Testing:** Jest (unit) & Playwright (E2E) & Artillery (Load)
- **Containerization:** Docker & Docker Compose
- **Deployment:** GitHub Actions → OVH VPS



## Features

- User authentication (login/register via API)  
- Role-based profiles (Investor / Startup)  
- Matching system between investors & startups  
- Real-time messaging dialog (chat)  
- Search 
- Responsive card grid UI  
- Snack notifications (match status, errors, success)  
- Lazy loading and caching  
- Full CI/CD pipeline with tests and container build  


